sequenceDiagram
  participant AG as Agent UI
  participant API as AI endpoint
  participant SAN as Sanitizer and Redactor
  participant PR as AiProvider (mock default)
  participant DS as Suggestion store
  participant T as Ticket comments
  AG->>API: POST /tickets/id/ai/analyze
  API->>SAN: strip and redact PII, bound length
  SAN->>PR: sanitized ticket + KB candidates (timeout, bounded retry)
  alt provider ok
    PR-->>API: summary, category, priority, reply, confidence
    API->>DS: save PENDING_REVIEW + audit
    API-->>AG: suggestion (generated true)
  else timeout or failure
    API-->>AG: degraded true + fallback message
  end
  AG->>API: approve (optionally edited) or reject
  API->>T: post reply as comment only on approve
  API->>DS: record decision + audit + event
